cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it as below."
title: "SwathCast for QGIS"
abstract: >-
  A QGIS plugin that forecasts when Earth-observation satellites (Sentinel-1/2/3,
  Landsat 8/9, CBERS-4/4A, Amazonia-1, MODIS, VIIRS, PACE, EnMAP, PRISMA) will image an
  area, and lists the scenes the agencies' catalogues hold for past dates, with the
  evidence each forecast rests on.
type: software
authors:
